# MCP and analysis

Keep the set small. Do not add Playwright, Sequential Thinking, filesystem, CodeRabbit, Knip, or MUI MCP.

| Task | Use |
| --- | --- |
| Express 4 / Mongoose 6 / Jest 28 / jsonwebtoken 8 | Context7, pin those majors |
| GitHub issues / PRs | GitHub MCP if authenticated, else `gh` |
| Swagger click-through on `:8080` | Built-in Browser (Cursor) |
| Network (status, CORS, payload, cookies, failed `/auth`) | `chrome-devtools`: `list_network_requests` / `get_network_request`. Do not drive the same page with Browser and Chrome DevTools at once. |
| Code review | Cursor Bugbot / Security Review subagents (`/review-bugbot`, `/review-security`). Not an extra MCP. |
| Unused imports | `npm run lint`. `eslint:recommended` already flags unused bindings. |
| Dead files / unused exports / unused deps | `npx knip@5` (Node 18). Official `@knip/mcp` needs Node 20+ — do not add it here. Report only; do not mass-delete in this fork. |

GitHub: `GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN` (Cursor: also `/add-plugin github`). Context7: optional `CONTEXT7_API_KEY`. Chrome DevTools needs local Chrome. Cursor: `.cursor/mcp.json`. VS Code: `.vscode/mcp.json` + `.github/copilot-instructions.md`. Claude Code: `CLAUDE.md` + `.mcp.json`.
